{"type":"text","timestamp":1790380318220,"sessionID":"ses_f2504bb9effeKKsJPk3qB3jK2T","part":{"id":"prt_0dafb9df9001CZ0oYEiCxUw21B","messageID":"msg_0dafb701f001J6Gz4V9GS3aSg0","sessionID":"ses_f2504bb9effeKKsJPk3qB3jK2T","type":"text","text":"The projectile scene has no `area_entered` signal connection, and its current quest identifiers do not match the resource (`shoot_em_up` / `kill_step`). I’ll wire the overlap signal, use the resource’s IDs, and replace the top-only check with a 50-pixel margin around the full viewport.","time":{"start":1790380318201,"end":1790380318204},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_02a7b7108dd96ac4016ab7091b765081968ab18c0bcb64fb66","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790380318245,"sessionID":"ses_f2504bb9effeKKsJPk3qB3jK2T","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_cOS17KzXJ74VZZ5cIdWU8kx0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/projectile.gd\n@@\n extends Area2D\n \n @export var speed := 400.0\n \n-# Reference to the QuestManager\n-var quest_manager\n-\n-func _ready():\n-\t# Get the QuestManager instance\n-\tquest_manager = get_node(\"/root/QuestManager\")\n-\tif quest_manager == null:\n-\t\t# If QuestManager is not found in the scene tree, try to load it from addons\n-\t\tvar quest_manager_script = preload(\"res://addons/quest_manager/QuestManager.gd\")\n-\t\tquest_manager = quest_manager_script.new()\n-\t\t# Add it to the scene tree if needed\n-\t\tget_tree().root.add_child(quest_manager)\n-\t\tquest_manager.name = \"QuestManager\"\n-\n-func _physics_process(delta):\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tarea_entered.connect(_on_area_entered)\n+\n+func _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n \tposition += Vector2(0, -speed) * delta\n-\t\n-\t# Remove projectile if it goes far off screen (50 pixels above the top)\n-\tif position.y < -50:\n+\n+\tif not get_viewport_rect().grow(50.0).has_point(global_position):\n \t\tqueue_free()\n \n-func _on_area_2d_area_entered(area):\n-\t# Check if the area that entered is an enemy\n+func _on_area_entered(area: Area2D) -> void:\n \tif area.is_in_group(\"enemy\"):\n-\t\t# Call QuestManager to progress the kill step\n-\t\tif quest_manager != null:\n-\t\t\tquest_manager.progress_quest(\"shoot_em_up_quest\", \"kill\")\n-\t\t# Queue the projectile to free itself after hitting an enemy\n+\t\tQuestManager.progress_quest(\"shoot_em_up\", \"kill_step\")\n \t\tqueue_free()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/projectile.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/projectile.gd\n===================================================================